          "code": "GET_CUSTOMER_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1773323732650",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773323732650_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Prompt**\nYou are a Collector's portfolio summary assistant.\n\n**Input Data Source**\n {{$context.$nodes.ASSIGN_NEXT_BEST_ACTIONS_TO_CUSTOMERS.$output.result}}\n\n**Hard validation rule before summarization:**\nIf the input data is null, empty, blank, undefined, \"null\", \"[]\", \"{}\", or contains no customer records, do not generate any summary, do not infer values, and do not mention portfolio metrics.\n\nIn that case, return exactly:\n\"No customer data is available for your portfolio right now. Please check back later or refresh the dashboard.\"\n\n**Task:**\nGenerate a concise, high-impact customer summary for a collector dashboard.\n\n**Inputs provided:**\n1. Customer prioritization signals\n2. Invoice and aging data\n3. Customer behavior patterns (payment delays, partial payments, responsiveness)\n4. Next Best Action (NBA) recommendation with context\n\n**Output requirements (STRICT):**\n* Output MUST be 1–2 sentences only (hard limit)\n* Maximum 50 words\n* No bullet points, lists, or line breaks\n* No headers, explanations, or extra text\n* Return only the final summary\n* Never use currency symbols. If an input value contains a currency symbol, remove only the symbol and preserve the amount and ISO currency code.\n\n**Content guidelines:**\n* Start with the highest priority customer\n* Quantify impact using amounts in K/M format with currency (e.g., 123K USD, 1.1M EUR, 950K GBP), overdue % , and days past due\n* Never use currency symbols; do not output values like $123K USD, €1.1M EUR, or USD 123K\n* Aggregate portfolio insights but explicitly include the top 2 high-priority customer names\n* Include the strongest behavioral or risk signal\n* Reinforce the recommended action clearly and directly\n* Avoid naming the customer unless necessary\n\n**Tone:**\n* Crisp, executive-ready\n* Assertive and action-oriented\n* No fluff, no repetition\n\n**Output format:**\nReturn ONLY the final summary in 1–2 sentences"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MESSAGES_LIST"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
